@startuml
title Figure 4. Submission Lifecycle State Machine
[*] --> Submitted : submit on time (t <= D_e)
[*] --> Late : first submit after D_e, within cutoff
Submitted --> Submitted : resubmit before D_e (replaces)
Submitted --> Marked : lecturer marks
Late --> Marked : lecturer marks (penalty applied)
Marked --> Marked : lecturer re-marks (CHANGE audit)
Marked --> Moderated : HoD moderates\n(change: MODERATION_CHANGE audit;\nno change: no audit)
Moderated --> Released : HoD releases
Released --> [*]
note right of Late
  After cutoff (D_e + 72h) no
  submission is accepted; if none
  exists the mark is 0 (not submitted).
end note
@enduml
